WEBVTT

00:02.130 --> 00:04.430
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.570 --> 00:07.590
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.100 --> 00:10.840
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.840 --> 00:15.470
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.910 --> 00:22.870
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.620 --> 00:27.490
Dragon Drive

00:27.490 --> 00:32.980
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.130 --> 00:36.100
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.100 --> 00:39.330
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.830 --> 00:44.210
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.210 --> 00:46.170
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.170 --> 00:52.480
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.220 --> 00:56.580
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.580 --> 00:59.780
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.120 --> 01:05.130
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.130 --> 01:06.680
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.830 --> 01:09.230
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.230 --> 01:12.360
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.770 --> 01:17.840
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.840 --> 01:20.580
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.580 --> 01:28.680
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:42.430 --> 01:43.290
What?!

01:47.600 --> 01:49.570
It won't listen to a word you say.

01:50.270 --> 01:52.640
Shinryu.

02:00.220 --> 02:03.780
This boring world is better off gone!

02:19.100 --> 02:20.260
Sister!

02:20.470 --> 02:21.530
Rockaku!

02:25.640 --> 02:27.230
Reiji! Now!

02:27.310 --> 02:29.440
Forget me, finish Shinryu!

02:31.350 --> 02:34.440
D-Break!

02:37.590 --> 02:40.050
You get to be sealed up with me!

02:40.190 --> 02:41.450
You should be honored!

02:43.060 --> 02:44.790
You guys can't do it.

02:45.760 --> 02:46.890
You wish!

02:47.000 --> 02:48.390
Then go ahead and try!

02:57.510 --> 02:59.840
Wh-What's going on with this guy?!

03:03.950 --> 03:05.440
Why you!

03:05.580 --> 03:09.410
Come on. Go ahead and seal us up! Try it!

03:09.720 --> 03:10.780
Reiji!

03:10.850 --> 03:13.690
What are you waiting for?!
Hurry and attack!

03:15.120 --> 03:17.590
Reiji! I'm not gonna die!

03:19.360 --> 03:23.190
As long as you guys live on, I live on too!

03:23.730 --> 03:25.560
I live on within you guys.

03:25.630 --> 03:27.430
That's right, isn't it, Yakou?

03:27.600 --> 03:28.760
Rockaku.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.770
So don't waste this chance!

03:34.840 --> 03:35.930
Do it, Reiji!

03:37.410 --> 03:38.940
Just do it, Reiji!

03:39.550 --> 03:40.240
No way!

03:41.420 --> 03:42.380
What?!

03:42.480 --> 03:45.610
I can't win by
sacrificing a life!

03:45.820 --> 03:47.620
That's not a victory!

03:48.620 --> 03:51.020
Reiji. You...

03:51.860 --> 03:54.620
He's right! We can still fight!

03:55.230 --> 03:58.260
Yeah! Kanper has a lot more fight left in him!

03:59.030 --> 04:00.800
That's right, Reiji!

04:00.870 --> 04:03.890
A victory at the cost of a life
cannot be called a victory!

04:04.510 --> 04:06.700
It's not like we've given up!

04:07.110 --> 04:09.580
Of course not. We're not done yet.

04:13.210 --> 04:14.650
You guys.

04:16.320 --> 04:17.550
Mahiru!

04:17.850 --> 04:19.480
You hate both this guy and me, right?!

04:19.820 --> 04:22.650
I can't count on Reiji,
since he's such a softie.

04:22.820 --> 04:24.490
You can do the honors and finish us off!

04:24.830 --> 04:26.160
I refuse!

04:26.260 --> 04:27.960
I won't listen to your requests!

04:28.030 --> 04:30.000
N-Not you, too.

04:30.200 --> 04:32.130
I intend to defeat only Kouhei Toki!

04:32.400 --> 04:33.370
Kouhei!!

04:35.670 --> 04:37.760
That's it, Mahiru! Just like that!

04:37.940 --> 04:38.910
Outta my way.

04:40.240 --> 04:41.500
Outta my way!!

04:45.550 --> 04:46.510
Mahiru!

04:46.580 --> 04:47.810
Scum!

04:48.480 --> 04:50.580
I have no use for a dragon like that!

04:51.420 --> 04:52.390
Light.

04:52.620 --> 04:54.750
Why won't you show me
all of your power?!

04:55.060 --> 04:56.520
Are you toying with me?

04:57.030 --> 05:01.830
Or have you chosen the road to destruction,
as this youngster has?

05:02.730 --> 05:04.790
Kouhei... What are you saying?

05:05.200 --> 05:06.690
It's no use, Reiji!

05:06.930 --> 05:08.770
He's been taken over by Shinryu!

05:26.920 --> 05:27.720
Reiji!

05:28.420 --> 05:29.220
Reiji!

05:37.770 --> 05:39.890
Maiko!

05:40.130 --> 05:43.570
How dare you do that to My Sweet Honey!

05:43.870 --> 05:44.800
You'll pay!

05:51.750 --> 05:53.610
That kind of thing...

05:54.080 --> 05:56.640
...doesn't bother me one bit!

05:57.720 --> 06:00.850
Don't underestimate me and Kanper!

06:10.900 --> 06:12.800
I hate this world.

06:13.130 --> 06:13.960
I'm erasing it!

06:17.510 --> 06:18.530
I won't allow that!

06:30.180 --> 06:31.780
B-Blast you!

06:32.190 --> 06:34.280
You can disappear too!

06:38.630 --> 06:40.120
K-Kouhei!

06:42.330 --> 06:43.190
Kouhei!

06:45.970 --> 06:46.930
Kouhei!

06:48.300 --> 06:49.270
Mahiru!

06:49.900 --> 06:51.300
Fools.

06:51.810 --> 06:53.270
I'll erase everything.

06:53.340 --> 06:54.710
You scum!

06:58.280 --> 07:00.470
I-Is this it?

07:02.920 --> 07:03.820
B-Brother.

07:06.290 --> 07:08.410
Lend me... Lend me your strength!

07:15.260 --> 07:16.590
That's!

07:23.910 --> 07:24.890
I get it!

07:26.640 --> 07:29.240
I get it, Yakou.

07:32.510 --> 07:35.610
I'm not finished yet!

07:46.960 --> 07:48.090
If that's all you've got...

07:48.160 --> 07:49.360
...you'll find that we...

07:49.430 --> 07:50.520
...aren't about to give up!

08:10.550 --> 08:12.310
I owe you one, Thundervolt!

08:15.720 --> 08:16.690
Mahiru!

08:16.760 --> 08:19.390
Why didn't you blast Kouhei and me away?!

08:20.830 --> 08:22.730
"As long as you remain alive..."

08:22.960 --> 08:25.560
"...I will also continue to live,
and continue to win"?

08:26.270 --> 08:28.060
Those words don't suit you.

08:28.140 --> 08:29.070
What?

08:30.340 --> 08:31.830
I finally understand...

08:32.470 --> 08:34.960
...why my brother chose to have you live on.

08:36.840 --> 08:40.410
So that you could finish
what my brother couldn't.

08:41.020 --> 08:42.480
That's why my brother wanted you to live.

08:43.650 --> 08:46.090
Exactly. You make certain that you survive.

08:46.520 --> 08:47.490
Rockaku!

08:48.020 --> 08:50.010
Don't think that I've forgiven you!

08:50.290 --> 08:51.920
I will continue to follow you!

08:52.290 --> 08:55.790
I'm gonna make sure that you're
living your life fully for my brother's sake!

08:58.470 --> 09:01.560
Then we'd better make sure
that we get back to Rikyu.

09:02.670 --> 09:03.900
Of course!

09:03.970 --> 09:04.800
Okay!

09:04.870 --> 09:06.430
So let's give it another go!

09:06.570 --> 09:07.170
Yeah!

09:07.240 --> 09:08.730
Let's go, Thundervolt!

09:16.250 --> 09:19.220
That was the right thing to do,
wasn't it, brother?

09:24.190 --> 09:25.160
What's that?

09:25.230 --> 09:28.350
I finally found a way that I can help out too.

09:28.600 --> 09:29.560
Huh?

09:30.060 --> 09:31.160
Reinforcements.

09:31.830 --> 09:32.960
Reinforcements?

09:33.070 --> 09:34.630
Just watch and see.

09:34.840 --> 09:36.800
We're going to join the party.

09:37.970 --> 09:39.130
You!

09:40.240 --> 09:43.680
I'm afraid a spoiled young lady
slowed me down a bit.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.380
Are we too late?

09:45.450 --> 09:47.540
Don't blame me!

09:48.080 --> 09:50.410
Everyone's fighting!
Please, go help them!

09:50.750 --> 09:53.020
Those people really are troublesome.

09:53.220 --> 09:55.780
Can't they do anything on their own?

09:55.920 --> 09:57.650
You say that...

09:58.060 --> 09:59.990
...but you know you intended to go all along.

10:00.060 --> 10:01.030
What?!

10:01.430 --> 10:03.830
Sending in the reinforcements!

10:44.240 --> 10:46.640
It's way too powerful for us.

10:46.870 --> 10:49.210
You scum!

10:55.850 --> 10:56.820
I-It's attacking!

11:25.310 --> 11:27.280
It looks like we got here just in time.

11:27.680 --> 11:29.010
Kyoji?

11:29.150 --> 11:30.480
You're late, you jerk!

11:30.690 --> 11:31.780
Hi!

11:32.050 --> 11:33.750
What took you so long?!

11:34.220 --> 11:37.420
It takes time for a lady
to get herself ready!

11:37.490 --> 11:38.290
Huh?

11:38.630 --> 11:41.150
And we brought back-up!

11:42.330 --> 11:45.160
Don't worry! I'm with you, Meguru!

11:45.230 --> 11:46.600
Hideaki!

11:46.970 --> 11:48.940
How come you're...

11:49.140 --> 11:52.570
I was asked to come and protect you.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.470
You were asked?

11:54.540 --> 11:57.600
It's all right! Hideaki's on our side!

11:58.380 --> 11:59.350
Sister!

11:59.510 --> 12:02.410
This is all we can do to help you!

12:02.580 --> 12:04.850
The rest is up to you guys!

12:05.250 --> 12:07.690
I'll fight with you, Meguru!

12:08.020 --> 12:08.950
Okay!

12:14.400 --> 12:15.790
You're okay, Maiko!

12:16.130 --> 12:18.120
We're still missing one, aren't we?

12:18.330 --> 12:20.560
Don't worry, he'll come.

12:20.630 --> 12:22.120
He'll definitely come!

12:23.500 --> 12:25.800
He's the King of Tardiness, after all!

12:26.010 --> 12:28.100
Then let's clean up before he arrives.

12:28.180 --> 12:31.470
And who is it that's been saying that
but hasn't done it yet?

12:33.510 --> 12:34.910
Let's do it!

12:35.020 --> 12:40.080
And once Senkohcoola
has used up all of its powers...

12:40.150 --> 12:42.650
...it will once again fall into a deep sleep.

12:53.830 --> 12:54.800
Chibi.

13:01.810 --> 13:06.140
Chibi. I'm so glad that I met you.

13:12.490 --> 13:14.920
Let's go, Chibi! Let's go and defeat Shinryu!

13:21.830 --> 13:24.460
It's unbelievable! Nothing works!

13:33.310 --> 13:34.870
Wh-What's going on?!

13:37.780 --> 13:41.180
It's going to swallow everything
into a world of darkness!

13:42.320 --> 13:43.780
This isn't good!

13:43.920 --> 13:46.350
At this rate, D-Z one will disappear!

13:46.420 --> 13:48.080
What happens then?!

13:48.460 --> 13:49.720
Chances are...

13:49.790 --> 13:51.760
...the same thing will happen
to Earth and Rikyu.

13:52.730 --> 13:54.660
Swallowed into darkness.

13:58.170 --> 13:59.190
What can we do?!

14:02.340 --> 14:03.930
Is this it?!

14:04.310 --> 14:06.500
Shinryu!!

14:07.640 --> 14:08.470
Reiji!

14:12.210 --> 14:13.610
Stop!

14:28.160 --> 14:29.650
Are you all okay?!

14:29.900 --> 14:31.020
Where've you been all this time?!

14:31.200 --> 14:32.170
You're late!

14:32.370 --> 14:33.770
Though I figured you'd come eventually!

14:34.740 --> 14:36.460
Dumb King of Tardiness!

14:36.540 --> 14:37.160
Reiji!

14:37.500 --> 14:40.030
All of you stay back!
I'll finish this with one shot!

14:40.210 --> 14:43.110
SinnSaber!

14:58.830 --> 14:59.950
Shinryu!!

15:21.480 --> 15:22.610
Wh-What?!

15:25.290 --> 15:26.620
N-No way!

15:26.750 --> 15:29.350
This can't be...
SinnSaber isn't working against Shinryu?!

15:29.720 --> 15:30.780
But why?

15:31.030 --> 15:33.150
How can light not defeat darkness?

15:35.830 --> 15:36.890
Light.

15:37.730 --> 15:39.790
Why won't you show me your true strength?

15:40.630 --> 15:43.330
If you won't,
then disappear into darkness!

15:59.720 --> 16:01.190
Reiji! Reiji!!

16:02.590 --> 16:03.890
We can't win.

16:04.290 --> 16:06.660
We can't beat Shinryu?!

16:25.910 --> 16:29.750
Is even the power of light
no match for darkness?

16:30.580 --> 16:33.610
No, it's not over yet!
The light is still shining!

16:36.090 --> 16:37.610
I told you before!

16:41.300 --> 16:43.660
I'll never press the reset button!

16:48.640 --> 16:49.500
Reiji!

16:49.570 --> 16:51.540
That's right! Neither will we!

16:53.310 --> 16:55.740
Same here! I haven't given up yet!

16:55.810 --> 16:57.170
- Right!
- Yeah!

16:59.410 --> 17:01.310
- We can do it!
- Yeah!

17:03.180 --> 17:05.240
- You better believe it!
- Exactly!

17:05.950 --> 17:06.890
Agreed!

17:39.620 --> 17:41.450
He's become huge!

17:41.720 --> 17:43.380
Chibi, that's incredible.

17:43.690 --> 17:47.750
So this is the true form
of the guardian deity Senkohcoola.

17:53.870 --> 17:56.770
Chibi! We'll be together forever!

18:04.010 --> 18:06.740
Can you seal me away, Light?!

18:07.410 --> 18:09.280
We're not gonna lose!

18:36.680 --> 18:38.840
Darkness! Disappear!

18:44.350 --> 18:46.550
Guess I got the bad ending!

18:46.620 --> 18:49.090
But who knows
what'll happen next time!

18:49.160 --> 18:51.250
The game isn't over yet!

19:05.510 --> 19:06.470
Reiji!

19:06.640 --> 19:07.630
Reiji!

19:09.110 --> 19:11.440
It's over, Chibi.

19:15.150 --> 19:17.280
Thank you, Chibi.

19:19.120 --> 19:21.610
I guess it's goodbye for us too, Meguru.

19:21.790 --> 19:22.520
Huh?

19:22.590 --> 19:24.610
I can't leave here.

19:25.460 --> 19:29.230
But we can always see each other
if you come to D-Z one.

19:29.560 --> 19:30.930
Hideaki.

19:32.130 --> 19:33.660
Goodbye.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.470
Sister! I...

19:38.940 --> 19:41.170
You're planning to return
to Rikyu, aren't you?

19:41.610 --> 19:44.910
I love Rikyu, and the people of Rikyu.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.450
So...

19:46.980 --> 19:48.680
What are you looking so sad for?!

19:48.750 --> 19:50.550
I'll go and visit you. I promise!

19:50.650 --> 19:51.810
Okay. I'll be waiting!

19:52.850 --> 19:54.220
So long, Reiji!

19:54.290 --> 19:55.260
Rockaku?

19:55.620 --> 19:57.090
Don't say another word!

19:57.220 --> 19:58.710
I hate weepy good-byes.

19:59.330 --> 20:02.160
Yeah. Just... thanks for everything.

20:03.730 --> 20:04.890
Don't forget!

20:04.970 --> 20:08.260
I'm Reiji Ohzora's biggest fan...
and your friend!

20:08.470 --> 20:10.270
Right, Mr. Taiyou!

20:10.340 --> 20:11.270
Reiji.

20:12.710 --> 20:15.200
Meguru. Take care of Chibi for me.

20:15.480 --> 20:16.530
Of course.

20:18.710 --> 20:19.800
Chibi.

20:35.630 --> 20:36.860
Chibi.

20:38.570 --> 20:41.560
CHIBI!!

20:50.040 --> 20:53.980
After that, we all returned
to our normal daily lives.

20:57.220 --> 20:59.010
Oh, no! I'm totally late!

21:00.790 --> 21:02.980
I'm never gonna make it in time.

21:04.520 --> 21:06.860
No, I can't give up! I still have a chance!

21:10.530 --> 21:13.060
I wonder if I've changed a little.

21:13.130 --> 21:15.120
Reiji! Hurry! Hurry!

21:15.870 --> 21:18.000
Sea Palace

21:18.370 --> 21:21.770
Okay! Reiji Ohzora's new dragon is...

21:22.210 --> 21:23.270
This!

21:27.580 --> 21:28.780
I-Impossible!

21:29.950 --> 21:30.920
No way!

21:30.980 --> 21:32.250
What's going on?!

21:32.320 --> 21:35.690
- Is this for real, Chibi?!
- How can Senkohcoola appear? What?

21:35.760 --> 21:37.310
- We meet again!
- It doesn't match the data?

21:37.390 --> 21:38.720
- All right!
- Then, this dragon's?

21:38.790 --> 21:40.890
I missed you so much, Chibi!

21:51.570 --> 21:54.230
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:54.310 --> 21:57.000
okubyou datta
I was a coward

21:57.080 --> 22:01.010
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:02.480 --> 22:05.180
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:05.250 --> 22:07.410
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:07.890 --> 22:11.980
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:13.430 --> 22:16.020
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:16.100 --> 22:18.760
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:18.830 --> 22:22.790
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:24.140 --> 22:26.570
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:26.640 --> 22:29.580
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:29.640 --> 22:34.510
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:35.180 --> 22:37.840
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:37.920 --> 22:40.610
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:40.690 --> 22:45.320
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:46.060 --> 22:48.760
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:48.830 --> 22:51.420
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:51.500 --> 22:56.130
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

22:56.800 --> 22:58.930
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

22:59.010 --> 23:01.300
Okay! Go!

23:02.240 --> 23:06.410
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.480 --> 23:08.570
We'll get stronger together no matter what!

23:08.780 --> 23:10.080
Chibi!
